flowchart TD
  Assess[Existing military need and coverage assessment] --> Publish[Publish changed rear shortage including zero]
  Publish --> Pending{Owned forward key Pending or Ready?}
  Pending -->|No| Existing[Existing admitted or ordinary new-plan handling]
  Pending -->|Yes| Compare{Captured quantity exceeds current need?}
  Compare -->|No| Preserve[Keep useful unadmitted plan]
  Compare -->|Yes| Retire[Retire only this unadmitted freight key]
  Retire --> Positive{Positive current load?}
  Positive -->|Yes| New[Prepare fresh key and routes]
  Positive -->|No| Quiet[No additional forward load]
  New --> Guard[Running Ready: one source-owned current-need check]
  Guard -->|Current| Ready[Fresh physical guard and atomic admission]
  Guard -->|Obsolete or expired source| Blocked[No claims or job; next policy assessment owns fresh preparation]
  Ready --> Job[Existing physical Loading job owns claims and cargo]
